    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre N1 through O. It crosses the horizontal line again at N7, right of N1. Draw a circle with centre N7 and opening from O to N1. It crosses that line at N8, right of N7. Draw a circle with centre N4 and opening from O to N8. It crosses that line at N9, right of N4.",
